[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4154766638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117964#issuecomment-4154766638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117964","id":4154766638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73pLUu","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-30T12:43:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T12:43:51Z","body":"Was this PR authored using AI tooling? As stated in the [pull request guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#ai-assisted-contributions) you must disclose what parts (if any) you used it for.\r\n\r\nThe change itself isn't necessarily wrong, but it's incomplete, since it only covers `RigidBody3D`, and none of the other nodes that rely on `body_set_state_sync_callback`.\r\n\r\nAlso, using `is_equal_approx` here is not appropriate, in my opinion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4154766638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169865677","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117964#issuecomment-4169865677","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117964","id":4169865677,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74ixnN","user":{"login":"Lidang-Jiang","id":119769478,"node_id":"U_kgDOByOJhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119769478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang","html_url":"https://github.com/Lidang-Jiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T12:48:43Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T12:48:43Z","body":"Yes, I used AI tooling (Claude Code) to assist with writing and reviewing the code. I reviewed and tested all modifications myself.\n\nThanks for the review! I've addressed both points in f666b5f:\n\n**`is_equal_approx` replaced with freeze guard:**\nYou're right that `is_equal_approx` is not appropriate here. I've replaced it with a freeze-mode guard matching the pattern already used in `RigidBody2D::_sync_body_state`:\n```cpp\nif (!freeze || freeze_mode != FREEZE_MODE_KINEMATIC) {\n```\nThis directly targets the root cause — frozen kinematic bodies should not update their transform from the physics server — rather than doing a per-frame approximate comparison.\n\n**Other nodes using `body_set_state_sync_callback`:**\nI checked all other nodes that register this callback:\n- `PhysicalBone3D` — has no freeze mechanism; already guards via `simulate_physics` check in `_body_state_changed` (returns early if not simulating)\n- `AnimatableBody3D` / `AnimatableBody2D` — already guard via `sync_to_physics` check in `_body_state_changed`\n- `VehicleBody3D` — inherits from `RigidBody3D`, so this fix covers it automatically\n\nSo the missing guard was specific to `RigidBody3D`, which lacked the freeze check that `RigidBody2D` already had.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169865677/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4171100602","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117964#issuecomment-4171100602","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117964","id":4171100602,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74nfG6","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T16:00:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T16:00:16Z","body":"> You're right that `is_equal_approx` is not appropriate here. I've replaced it with a freeze-mode guard matching the pattern already used in `RigidBody2D::_sync_body_state`.\r\n\r\nI meant that you should just do a direct comparison instead of using `is_equal_approx`. The code you've copied from `RigidBody2D` is also not correct, as it will ([and does](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118077)) cause transform desync issues when you have a `RigidBody*D` that goes from non-frozen to frozen, since it will discard the (necessary) transform update that follows after setting `freeze` to `true`.\r\n\r\nI've put up a new pull request with the appropriate changes: #118080","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4171100602/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184257285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117964#issuecomment-4184257285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117964","id":4184257285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75ZrMF","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:42Z","body":"Superseded by #118080; thanks for your contribution!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184257285/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]